{"synopsis":"\"Dalam hidup ini, aku akan mendominasi medan perang.\"\n\nDamian, seorang centurion dari Unit Hukuman Kerajaan Barok.\n\n\"Sialan.\"\n\nHanya sekali saja.\n\nSeandainya aku diberi satu kesempatan lagi...\n\n\"Aku benar-benar akan mendominasi medan perang bersama orang-orang ini.\"\n\nIa menutup matanya pada usia 30 tahun di medan perang tanpa nama.\n\nNamun ketika ia membuka matanya, ia mendapati dirinya kembali 17 tahun ke masa lalu.\n\nDan bukan sembarang waktu, tetapi dengan Lubang Sihir yang masih utuh dan mampu menguasai sihir.\n\n\"Kali ini.\"\n\nAku akan bangkit lebih tinggi dari siapa pun.\n\nAlih-alih terpengaruh oleh era perang.\n\n\"Aku akan mendominasi.\"\n\nDamian kembali ke masa lalu dan mengayunkan tombaknya ke dunia..","alternative_title":"죽지 않는 천재 창잡이","author":"Wonha, Shin Yul (Novel)","artist":"Choi Bong-geun, Akeo Studio","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"79695edd-19a3-4349-89f2-9133f64d6b18","number":"27","chapter":"27","title":"","date":"2026-08-02","released":"2026-08-02","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_59a06700-0107-41b3-84d7-d158e91c91fa/chapter_ch_27/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_59a06700-0107-41b3-84d7-d158e91c91fa/chapter_ch_27/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_59a06700-0107-41b3-84d7-d158e91c91fa/chapter_ch_27/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_59a06700-0107-41b3-84d7-d158e91c91fa/chapter_ch_27/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_59a06700-0107-41b3-84d7-d158e91c91fa/chapter_ch_27/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_59a06700-0107-41b3-84d7-d158e91c91fa/chapter_ch_27/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_59a06700-0107-41b3-84d7-d158e91c91fa/chapter_ch_27/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_59a06700-0107-41b3-84d7-d158e91c91fa/chapter_ch_27/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_59a06700-0107-41b3-84d7-d158e91c91fa/chapter_ch_27/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_59a06700-0107-41b3-84d7-d158e91c91fa/chapter_ch_27/1